<h2 nodeId="88e9e65e-78fa-4ed1-96a3-7acc1e7bf354">1 核心概要 Executive Summary (BRT 9.7-9.13)</h2>
<h3 nodeId="a67909ad-df4c-462b-9c05-1d6f9ee57f08">1.1 一周小结 Weekly Summary</h3>
<p nodeId="f051beb4-8ff2-4a22-9f19-6adddb4d867d">9月首周（新政第一周）核心结论聚焦两项：①<strong>9月考核框架切换</strong>——BML菜单改价（25%）取代CI成为最大权重指标，权重排序变为 BML(25%) &gt; Orders(20%) &gt; NS/OpRate/CI(15%)，并新增防独R＄500、KM免运R＄50、堂食菜单+3%三项框架外现金激励；②<strong>BML启动进度</strong>——SP Metro任务池2,196家商户/8,859 SPU，首周完成1,345 SPU（<strong>15.2%</strong>），距60%达标线尚远但节奏已分化：Tadeu(32.1%)/Adriana(30.6%)领跑，Thiago(2.2%)/Lucas F.(2.9%)垫底；城市层面Southern 22.4%明显领先，Western(7.4%)/Santos(8.2%)需立即加速。过程端：81名BD全周拜访1,854次、人均4.6次/BD/天（低于5次标准）；竞对端Western出现<strong>Yellow R＄700K级现金独家报价</strong>，本周新增10家主表外风险商户，防独激励落地正当时。</p>
<p nodeId="0759d511-540e-4ee5-8de7-175e5df08ad8"><em>Sep week 1 (first week under the new framework) centers on two areas: (1) September assessment framework switch — BML menu price correction (25%) replaces CI as the largest-weight KPI; new cash incentives added for exclusivity defense (R＄500), KM free-shipping (R＄50) and dine-in menu (+3%). (2) BML launch progress — SP Metro task pool 2,196 merchants / 8,859 SPUs; 1,345 SPUs completed in week 1 (15.2%). Tadeu (32.1%) and Adriana (30.6%) lead; Thiago (2.2%) and Lucas F. (2.9%) trail. Southern leads at city level (22.4%) while Western (7.4%) and Santos (8.2%) need immediate acceleration. Process: 1,854 visits by 81 BDs (4.6/BD/day, below the 5.0 bar); competitor side saw Yellow's R＄700K-class cash exclusivity offers in Western — 10 new off-list risk merchants this week, right as the exclusivity-defense incentive lands.</em></p>
