    <td nodeId="28e23d1f-49c0-43d6-b11f-b27029612eab"><p nodeId="0ef3e9aa-4144-4cce-9588-fcbf972529af">🟡 <strong>订单为8月唯一全员无突破维度（12/12停在0.8档），9月权重不变(20%)，是BML之外的第二攻坚点。</strong> 8月复盘结论：目标设定合理性待复议、Key Merchant单量专项需启动。<em>Orders was August's only zero-breakthrough dimension (all 12 at 0.8); weight unchanged at 20% — the second battlefront after BML. August review: target-setting reasonability under review, key-merchant volume program to launch.</em> <strong>Action:</strong> 1) 启动Key Merchant单量专项 2) 复制igorfeitosa 89.2%达成路径</p></td>
