    <td nodeId="0f4de074-3e36-4918-9540-8614f19e31ea"><p nodeId="d587f4e3-af47-43a8-b744-a8d0abdfc8f8">🟡 <strong>营业率口径切换是9月三大变化之一：不可抗力（独家、永久倒闭）流失可申请豁免。</strong> 8月93.9%距95%目标差1.1pp，Eduardo(92.3%)/Lucas F.(90.6%)仍最低。9月流失判定窗口为9.17-9.30最后两周。<em>The op-rate logic switch is one of Sep's three big changes: force-majeure churn (exclusivity, permanent closure) can now be exempted. Aug closed at 93.9%, 1.1pp below the 95% bar. Sep churn assessment window: Sep 17-30.</em> <strong>Action:</strong> 1) 本周内完成不可抗力流失商家豁免清单申报 2) Eduardo/Lucas F.营业率专项延续</p></td>
