<h3 nodeId="b0b94dc9-ac27-4a5e-abe8-91dc0d1469f0">1.3 管理者绩效结果进展 Manager Performance Progress</h3>
<p nodeId="c14ef3af-d82b-4f73-90f1-4df2c2eb048d">9月新政首周，绩效Wiki（8月版框架）数据待BDM Excel到位后更新；本期以BML维度为先导排名：Tadeu(32.1%)与Adriana(30.6%)构成第一梯队，Thiago(2.2%)、Lucas F.(2.9%)、Renata(4.9%)为末三位——按9月权重(25%)测算，BML首周进度差已拉开约7.5pp的综合系数差。</p>
<p nodeId="9be7701d-2075-432b-94e5-3772d842f114"><em>First week under the September framework; the performance wiki (August basis) updates once the BDM Excel arrives. This week's leading indicator is BML: Tadeu (32.1%) and Adriana (30.6%) form the top tier; Thiago (2.2%), Lucas F. (2.9%) and Renata (4.9%) the bottom three — at 25% weight, the week-1 BML gap already translates to roughly a 7.5pp composite-coefficient spread.</em></p>
