<h2 nodeId="9d0155c3-7dfd-44cd-8efe-2dbd98dfc467">2 本月重点任务 Key Priorities This Month</h2>
<h3 nodeId="14dd29bf-fb94-44f7-9f81-e881163576be">BML菜单改价落地 BML Menu Price Correction Rollout</h3>
<p nodeId="b0e8cb20-9b3a-49de-bd49-c4a654be138d">9月核心项目：治理虚假折扣菜（虚高原价），对标Red完成原价校正。SP Metro任务池<strong>2,196家商户 / 8,859 SPU</strong>（全SMB总池~6,100家/~25,000 SPU），其中约75%的SPU价格高于Red 1.1倍、25%折扣价高于90天历史最低原价。成功定义（SPU口径）：①Keeta原价调低至≤目标价（Red原价或历史最低价）；②或抬高Red原价至≥Keeta价，且<strong>维持到月底最后3天</strong>。9-10月完成原价治理，11月启动折后价治理。</p>
<p nodeId="4eb2b016-160c-4272-8832-16fef83350c9"><em>September's core initiative: correct inflated original prices of fake-discount items, benchmarked against Red. SP Metro task pool: 2,196 merchants / 8,859 SPUs (of ~6,100 / ~25,000 SMB-wide); ~75% of SPUs priced above 1.1x Red, 25% above the 90-day historical low. Success (per SPU): ① lower the Keeta original price to ≤ target, or ② raise the Red original price to ≥ Keeta's — and hold through the last 3 days of the month. Original-price governance runs Sep-Oct, discounted-price governance starts November.</em></p>
